<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item>
      <h2>First clue: where did it happen?</h2>
      <p font-size="lg"><b>South America → Brazil → Rio Grande do Sul</b></p>
      <freeform-block w="840" h="285">
        <shape preset="roundRect" x="0" y="0" w="240" h="275" fill="surface" stroke="palette-5" stroke-width="1"></shape>
        <shape preset="teardrop" x="72" y="112" w="96" h="122" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0" rotation="8"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="116" y="194" w="24" h="24" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <box type="content" x="20" y="18" w="200" sizing="auto">
          <p role="eyebrow">1 · Continent</p>
          <h3>South America</h3>
          <p>Brazil is one country on this continent.</p>
        </box>

        <shape preset="rightArrow" x="250" y="124" w="38" h="26" fill="palette-3" stroke-width="0"></shape>

        <shape preset="roundRect" x="300" y="0" w="240" h="275" fill="surface" stroke="palette-5" stroke-width="1"></shape>
        <shape preset="teardrop" x="374" y="108" w="90" h="126" fill="palette-3" stroke-width="0" rotation="14"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="412" y="211" w="25" h="25" fill="accent" stroke-width="0"></shape>
        <box type="content" x="320" y="18" w="200" sizing="auto">
          <p role="eyebrow">2 · Country</p>
          <h3>Brazil</h3>
          <p>Look toward the far south of the country.</p>
        </box>
        <box type="content" x="377" y="239" w="116" h="25" sizing="fixed" vertical-align="center" background-color="accent" style="padding: 4pt 8pt; border-radius: 999pt;">
          <p align="center" font-size="sm">Southern Brazil</p>
        </box>

        <shape preset="rightArrow" x="550" y="124" w="38" h="26" fill="palette-3" stroke-width="0"></shape>

        <shape preset="roundRect" x="600" y="0" w="240" h="275" fill="surface" stroke="palette-5" stroke-width="1"></shape>
        <shape preset="roundRect" x="650" y="125" w="140" h="92" fill="palette-2" stroke-width="0" rotation="-3"></shape>
        <shape preset="ellipse" x="703" y="154" w="34" h="34" fill="accent" stroke="palette-3" stroke-width="3"></shape>
        <box type="content" x="620" y="18" w="200" sizing="auto">
          <p role="eyebrow">3 · State</p>
          <h3>Rio Grande do Sul</h3>
          <p>The conflict was centered here.</p>
        </box>
        <box type="content" x="675" y="223" w=" ninety" sizing="auto">
          <p align="center" font-size="sm"><b>Story center</b></p>
        </box>
      </freeform-block>
      <p font-size="sm"><b>Map note:</b> This classroom map is schematic, not an exact picture of historical borders. · Source: <a href="https://www.rs.gov.br/carta-de-servicos/servicos?servico=2268">Rio Grande do Sul government</a></p>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>